  m_text: "\u2022 ENDGAME CRAB BOSS\r\n\u2022 WORKERS <size=67%>(Sushi Chef, Prep
    Cook, Waitress, Restocker)</size>\r\n\u2022 <size=100%>DESSERTS & DESSERT MACHINE</size>\r\n\u2022
    NEW SUSHI VARIETIES\r\n\u2022 CUSTOM SUSHI\r\n\u2022 FISHING ROD VISUAL UPGRADES\r\n\u2022
    VIP CUSTOMERS\r\n\u2022 WEATHER SYSTEM\r\n\u2022 NEW SEA CREATURES\n\u2022 FORGOTTEN
    DEPTH VISUAL UPDATE\r\n\u2022 SURFBOARD\r\n\u2022 BICYCLE\r\n\u2022 <size=90%>GLOBAL
    FISHING LEADERBOARD</size>"
